Package: rk628-media-initd
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, rk628-rpi-dkms, v4l-utils, mawk | awk
Description: RK628 capture initialization for Raspberry Pi 4 and 5
 Detects the Raspberry Pi model, waits for a stable HDMI signal and
 configures the V4L2 capture path once. Provides an optional systemd
 service for initialization at boot.
